<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37251" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεύχομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>boast aloud, proclaim,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τι [εἶναι</span>] <i>boast</i> that
			. ., <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				533
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀργεῖαι γένος
			ἐξευχόμεσθα</span> we <i>boast to be</i> Argives by race,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				275
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. γένος</span>
			<i>boast of</i> it, ib.<i><span class="en">
				272
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pray earnestly for,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ὄψιν ἥκεις ὧνπερ ἐξηύχου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					215
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. et inf., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				930
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεύχομαι: ἀφίξομαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
